    LLM: 'Game: Trijumf. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Trijumf (Croatian Triumph) is a popular trick-taking game played along the Croatian coast and islands. It combines elements of Briscola and Tressette using a 40-card Italian deck. Features A-3-K ranking, trump suits, AkuÅ¾anje (declarations for bonus points), and plays to 401 or 501 points.',
